# The pictures follow an LFO on X-Wave and the resonance (2026-11-08, #84): Osc's and Sub · Drive's osc lane draw
# the wave as heard, Drones 2's curves the resonance as heard; the numbers stay the knobs'. The LFO at 26 s, each
# drone's send at 100; shots across part of a cycle.
notips
tap PLAY
set 47 74
set 55 0
set 52 0
set 17 0
set 38 0
set 15 1
set 14 100
set 36 1
set 35 100
wait 2000
tap EDIT
expect view 4
wait 3250
shot osc-a.png
wait 6500
shot osc-b.png
tap EDIT
expect view 5
wait 3250
shot sub-a.png
set 17 100
set 38 100
set 18 1
set 39 1
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap HOME
expect view 1
wait 3250
shot reso-a.png
wait 6500
shot reso-b.png
